{"4650150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hordes Of War", "steam_appid": 4650150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Player Testers Needed</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtesters Wanted ⚔️</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the war early and help shape HORDES OF WAR! Fight in massive battles, test classes, and give feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewards:</strong> Platinum Classes + Early Access Beta<br>Jump in now and become a founding player! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the Discord Announcements for more details!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HORDES OF WAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is a team-based fantasy war game where set in Ossengard 10 races and over 120 character classes battle for total control of a living, war-torn world. A long standing perpetual war...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two factions stand against each other:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/868eb043ceb559c7e6e539c145c49f8a.poster.avif?t=1783784513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/868eb043ceb559c7e6e539c145c49f8a.webm?t=1783784513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/868eb043ceb559c7e6e539c145c49f8a.mp4?t=1783784513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The Dawnguard Order (West)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dwarves<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/3138f9a999e4aae7161c939e87c43b08.avif?t=1783784513\" width=1440 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Men<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/2387514e990056e4c9fac90d3cffd440.avif?t=1783784513\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras_big/2387514e990056e4c9fac90d3cffd440.webp?t=1783784513 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood Elves<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/7b60550726a4961d21704ee3c6809771.avif?t=1783784513\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras_big/7b60550726a4961d21704ee3c6809771.webp?t=1783784513 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barbarians<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/7fce871372455d6e76d6d48ca8b5f03a.avif?t=1783784513\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras_big/7fce871372455d6e76d6d48ca8b5f03a.webp?t=1783784513 width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The Umbral Horde (East)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orcs<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/436b490df5ee5c14536bcd4ecd2bb18d.avif?t=1783784513\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblins<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/dd3cbbbe9234e1e5dae07b9ee7a91f88.avif?t=1783784513\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras_big/dd3cbbbe9234e1e5dae07b9ee7a91f88.webp?t=1783784513 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ogres<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/75c6b4295c84930e78994228038a7727.avif?t=1783784513\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras_big/75c6b4295c84930e78994228038a7727.webp?t=1783784513 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Elves<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/f8bd3fc342e60bc16ab5c547e503eb7c.avif?t=1783784513\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras_big/f8bd3fc342e60bc16ab5c547e503eb7c.webp?t=1783784513 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skeletons<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/0d8951e13106f77057164edba081be5e.avif?t=1783784513\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras_big/0d8951e13106f77057164edba081be5e.webp?t=1783784513 width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction fights to conquer all 10 kingdoms across the continent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > CORE GAMEPLAY,</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The War Begins – The Great Divide,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every campaign begins in the Great Divide, a massive mountain battlefield separating East and West.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/9643e0135598db78db4d48bc5745dc26.avif?t=1783784513\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The winning team becomes the attacking force,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The losing team becomes the defenders,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/868eb043ceb559c7e6e539c145c49f8a.poster.avif?t=1783784513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/868eb043ceb559c7e6e539c145c49f8a.webm?t=1783784513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/868eb043ceb559c7e6e539c145c49f8a.mp4?t=1783784513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Territory Conquest System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each victory:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The winning team votes on which connected enemy territory to invade next,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles progress across a persistent world map,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every win pushes your faction deeper into enemy lands,</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Siege-Based Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each territory contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple castles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A final HQ stronghold,</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attackers:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn at a forward HQ base camp,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push through castles one at a time,</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defenders:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn at their most forward castle,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall back as each castle is lost,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Only one castle can be attacked at a time to keep battles focused and strategic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Victory Conditions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attackers win by:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capturing all castles and the HQ,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defenders win by:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holding the line,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retaking lost castles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying the attacker’s HQ,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > RESOURCE SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each realm contains capturable resource zones:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mines → Iron,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logging Camps → Wood,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farms → Food,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These resources are critical to winning the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > CLASS-BASED STRATEGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special classes use resources to shape the battlefield:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Engineers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build siege weapons,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place ladders, barriers, and traps,</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Commanders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy forward spawn camps,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create flanking opportunities,</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Healers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal allies using resources,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sustain frontline pushes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > CASTLE UPGRADES &amp; DEFENSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teams can spend resources to fortify their positions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade gates (Wood → Reinforced Steel),</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire NPC defenders:,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall Archers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ground Units,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen castle defenses,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GOLD &amp; CLASS PROGRESSION:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players earn Gold from kills,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different classes are worth different amounts,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold is used to unlock and play new character classes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With over 120 classes, players can constantly evolve their playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > WHAT MAKES OSSENGARD UNIQUE:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive team-based siege warfare,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A persistent world map shaped by player decisions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep resource and class strategy,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique races fighting across 10 kingdoms,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match directly impacts the ongoing war,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > WE ARE LOOKING FOR PLAYTESTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re looking for players who:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love fantasy, warfare, and large-scale battles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy teamwork, strategy, and progression,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to help shape a game from the ground up,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > EARLY TESTER REWARDS,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct input on development,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early access to new features,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Founding Player” recognition,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The war for Ossengard has begun…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your side. Conquer the realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HORDES OF WAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is a team-based fantasy war game where set in Ossengard 10 races and over 120 character classes battle for total control of a living, war-torn world. A long standing perpetual war...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two factions stand against each other:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/868eb043ceb559c7e6e539c145c49f8a.poster.avif?t=1783784513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/extras/868eb043ceb559c7e6e539c145c49f8a.webm?t=1783784513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\">