 one castle can be attacked at a time to keep battles focused and strategic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Victory Conditions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attackers win by:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capturing all castles and the HQ,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defenders win by:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holding the line,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retaking lost castles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying the attacker’s HQ,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > RESOURCE SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each realm contains capturable resource zones:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mines → Iron,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logging Camps → Wood,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farms → Food,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These resources are critical to winning the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > CLASS-BASED STRATEGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special classes use resources to shape the battlefield:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Engineers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build siege weapons,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place ladders, barriers, and traps,</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Commanders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy forward spawn camps,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create flanking opportunities,</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Healers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal allies using resources,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sustain frontline pushes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > CASTLE UPGRADES &amp; DEFENSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teams can spend resources to fortify their positions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade gates (Wood → Reinforced Steel),</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire NPC defenders:,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall Archers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ground Units,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen castle defenses,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GOLD &amp; CLASS PROGRESSION:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players earn Gold from kills,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different classes are worth different amounts,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold is used to unlock and play new character classes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With over 120 classes, players can constantly evolve their playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > WHAT MAKES OSSENGARD UNIQUE:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive team-based siege warfare,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A persistent world map shaped by player decisions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep resource and class strategy,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique races fighting across 10 kingdoms,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match directly impacts the ongoing war,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > WE ARE LOOKING FOR PLAYTESTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re looking for players who:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love fantasy, warfare, and large-scale battles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy teamwork, strategy, and progression,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to help shape a game from the ground up,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > EARLY TESTER REWARDS,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct input on development,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early access to new features,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Founding Player” recognition,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The war for Ossengard has begun…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your side. Conquer the realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Massive team-based fantasy war across a living world. Choose a faction, master 120+ classes, siege castles, gather resources, and push the front line across 10 kingdoms. Every battle shapes the map—fight for total conquest in an endless, ever-changing war.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/4c05242178769c9706b954f7f84e8ee3eab36c1d/header.jpg?t=1783784513", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/d0386d98f51ce9f56ef02c38c5fa61814da80c7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783784513", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4650150/d0386d98f51ce9f56ef02c38c5fa61814da80c7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783784513", "website": "https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61589320614118", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-13600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-14700KF<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Brent Spicer"], "publishers": ["Perish Arts"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "29", "description": "Massively Multiplayer"}, {"id": "3", "descriptio